==Icelandic==
{{Icelandic declension hk sb 01|tungumál}}
===Etymology===
From {{gen}} of ''[[tunga]]'' meaning "[[tongue]]" (= ''[[tungu]]'' meaning "of tongue") + ''[[mál#Icelandic|mál]]'' meaning "[[speech]]". Literally meaning "speech of tongue".

===Noun===
'''tungumál''' {{n}}

# [[language]]

====Synonyms====
* (''language''): [[mál]] {{n}}, [[tunga]] {{n}}

